GAP-09: Add typed CloudClient methods for all business provisioning ops
  (createShop, updateShop, createEmployee, updateEmployee, createInvitation,
  acceptInvitation, querySubscriptions, createSubscription, updateSubscription,
  registerDevice, updateDevice, queryDevices)

GAP-11: Enforce subscription device limit in DeviceService.enrollDevice()
  - Added deviceLimit option to DeviceServiceOptions
  - Added DeviceLimitExceededError
  - Repository now has countActiveDevices() method
  - enrollDevice() checks active device count against deviceLimit before registering

GAP-12: Add missing business/employee event catalog entries and payloads
  - Events: EMPLOYEE_INVITED, EMPLOYEE_ACCEPTED, EMPLOYEE_ROLE_CHANGED,
    EMPLOYEE_REVOKED (mirrors Phase 2 provisioning chain)
  - Payloads: business.created/updated, employee.invited/accepted/role_changed/revoked
  - Added to ALL_EVENTS array

GAP-10: Already correct (isLanHost + authorizedAt present in entities.ts)
GAP-13: Already correct (expiration check at TeamService:acceptInvitation line 129)

Versions: business@0.1.0-alpha.2, team@0.1.0-alpha.3, subscription@0.1.0-alpha.2,
  devices@0.1.0-alpha.2, cloud@0.1.0-alpha.5, events@0.1.0-alpha.2
