+### 1.6 Cross-device PIN enrollment flow ✅
+
+`operational-auth.ts` implements the exact 5-step flow:
+
+1. `getEnrollmentState()` → detects `PIN_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED` ✅
+2. `beginEnrollment()` → calls `cloudApi.verifyPinForEnrollment(employeeId, pinProof, shopId, deviceId)` ✅
+3. Returns `enrollmentToken` from backend (GAP-04 fix: token no longer discarded) ✅
+4. `completeEnrollmentWithCloudVerify()` → `consumeEnrollmentToken()` atomically validates + consumes token ✅
+5. Backend stores `newPinVerifier` as canonical verifier, sets `Device.hasPin=true` ✅
